OL,3,GNEWSABurnham to urge Swinney to work
OL,4,Awith him on devolution during Scottish
OL,5,Avisit
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham will invite John Swinney
OL,8,Fto work with him on devolution and
OL,9,Funlock jobs and opportunities for every
OL,10,Farea of the country during a visit to
OL,11,FScotland later.
OL,13,FThe prime minister will say "there is
OL,14,Fno limit to what we can achieve for the
OL,15,Fpeople of Scotland" at an event in
OL,16,FNorth Lanarkshire.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
