OL,3,GNEWSABurnham to urge Swinney to work
OL,4,Awith him on devolution during Scottish
OL,5,Avisit
OL,6,
OL,7,FBurnham, the former Mayor of
OL,8,FManchester, has said he wants to
OL,9,Fdevolve more power to local areas
OL,10,Faround the UK, while the first minister
OL,11,Fhas called for a second Scottish
OL,12,Findependence referendum by 2031.
OL,14,FThe PM's visit coincides with the SNP's
OL,15,Fannual party conference in Aberdeen and
OL,16,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch's
OL,17,Flatest visit for an engagement in
OL,18,FGlasgow.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
